  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "Changing `EncDwarvenSpider02` 023A98 also needs `ccAARSSE001DwarvenMaintenanceSentinel` 00080C:ccafdsse001-dwesanctuary.esm (a Dwemer Sanctuary player-home construct, level 16; on *Automatons*): it uses 023A98 as its template but not for `Stats`. The Worker and the Guardian (rows above) do the same and keep their 6 and 16.",
      "Changing `EncDwarvenSpider01` 10EC86 does not change the Warped Dwarven Spider (`DLC1LD_EncDwarvenSpider00`, a row above, level 5): it uses 10EC86 as its template but not for `Stats`.",
      "The other rows: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "`DLCDwarvenPuzzleDungeon_SpiderSummer` 0008F9 (Repair Spider, 12) and `DLCDwarvenPuzzleDungeon_SpiderBossFAKE` 0008FD (the Sky Orchestrator scene copy, 75) (cctwbsse001-puzzledungeon.esm) are Dwarven Spiders with no template; both are on *Automatons*. The Sky Orchestrator itself is on *Unique Automatons*.",
      "Every other spider record (`EncDwarvenSpiderAmbush`, Aicantar's Spider, `DLC1LD_EncDwarvenSpider01`–`03`, the Aetherial Staff summons, the Kagrumez wrappers and pet, `DLCDwarvenPuzzleDungeon_RepairSpider`, `ccAFDSSE001_EncDwarvenSpiderAmbush`, `TreasCorpseDwarvenSpider` and every `Lvl*` wrapper) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
